      The keyword NISM II B Registrars to an Issue and Share Transfer Agents (Corporate) Certification Mock Test is fundamentally a misnomer because II-B is Mutual Fund and II-A is Corporate. We strongly advise candidates to be aware of this distinction to ensure they purchase the correct study module for their specific career path.
